    {
      "text": "Ekans curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "By dislocating its jaw, it can swallow prey larger than itself. After a meal, it curls up and rests.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The eggs of bird Pokémon are its favorite food. It swallows eggs whole, so sometimes an egg gets stuck, and Ekans faints.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
